## The catalogue

A `resource` is the database. Declare the shape and `nexus` derives a live **Ash** resource —
real CRUD, the inline `status` enum becomes a real constraint. No schema files, no migrations.

resource Product do
  name :text
  price :money
  stock :int
  status :draft | :live | :sold_out
end

The catalogue, rendered live from the Store (baked into this file as a JSON island; the same
`nexus.data.all("Product")` API reads it client-side, or a server/local-SQLite backend):

show Product
